# Sprint Plan Action Card - Universal Template Reference

## Overview

This document defines the universal template structure for all Sprint Plan Action Cards in the Kinetic system. Every protocol (Meta Surgeon, Index Diagnostic, Link Architecture, Content Opportunity, etc.) follows this exact 6-page structure with consistent state management, button logic, and progression flow.

## Purpose

Sprint Plan Action Cards are interactive, multi-step workflows that guide users through SEO optimization protocols. Each card:
- Presents a clear mission and strategic context
- Breaks complex tasks into 4 linear steps
- Generates technology-agnostic Cursor prompts
- Tracks completion and unlocks progression
- Integrates with E.V.O. analysis (for analysis-based protocols)

## Card Architecture

### 6-Page Structure

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Sprint Plan Action Card                │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Shared Header (all pages)              │
│  - Mission Title                        │
│  - Progress Line (0% → 95%)             │
│  - Entity Signal Label                  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Page 1: Mission Introduction           │
│  Page 2: Step 1 (Execution)             │
│  Page 3: Step 2 (Execution)             │
│  Page 4: Step 3 (Execution)             │
│  Page 5: Step 4 (Execution)             │
│  Page 6: Completion Status              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

