## Page Definitions

### Page 1: Mission Introduction

**Purpose**: Set strategic context and explain the "why" behind the protocol.

**HTML Structure**:
```html
<div class="sprint-card-page" data-page="1">
    <div class="strategist-insight">
        <svg class="strategist-icon"><!-- Sparkle icon --></svg>
        Strategist Insight:
    </div>
    <div class="insight-blockquote">
        <!-- Dynamic insight message from protocol definition -->
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer">
        <button class="btn-continue">
            Continue
            <svg class="btn-arrow-icon"><!-- Arrow icon --></svg>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
```

**Key Elements**:
- `strategist-insight`: Visual header with sparkle icon
- `insight-blockquote`: Protocol-specific insight message (supports HTML with `{{PLACEHOLDERS}}`)
- `btn-continue`: Always enabled, advances to Page 2

**Dynamic Placeholders**:
- `{{COMPANY_NAME}}`: Replaced with business/property name
- `{{PROPERTY_NAME}}`: Replaced with GSC property name or domain

**Behavior**:
- Click "Continue" → Navigate to Page 2
- Update progress line to 25%

