### Page 6: Completion Status

**Purpose**: Animated completion feedback with status progression.

**HTML Structure**:
```html
<div class="sprint-card-page" data-page="6" style="display: none;">
    <div class="strategist-insight">
        <svg class="strategist-icon"><!-- Sparkle icon --></svg>
        Strategist:
    </div>
    
    <div class="status-container">
        <div class="status-line">
            Status: Scanning Source Code
            <span class="blink-dot">.</span>
            <span class="blink-dot">.</span>
            <span class="blink-dot">.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="status-line" style="display: none;">
            Status: Entity Signal Established.
        </div>
        <div class="status-line" style="display: none;">
            Success: Your business is now a verified entity. 4 Schema Packs Active.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

**Animation Sequence**:
1. Line 1 visible with blinking dots (scanning state)
2. After 2 seconds: Line 2 fades in (established state)
3. After 2 more seconds: Line 3 fades in (success state)
4. Trigger `sprintCardAnimationComplete` event
5. Unlock next sprint circle
6. Refresh completed cards archive
7. Close card after 1 second

**Status Messages**:
All messages come from protocol definition:
- `completion.scanning`: Initial scanning message
- `completion.established`: Mid-animation message
- `completion.success`: Final success message

