## Button State Management

### Button Types and Initial States

| Button | Location | Initial State | Enable Trigger |
|--------|----------|---------------|----------------|
| **Continue** | Page 1 | Enabled | Always |
| **Analysis** | Pages 2-5 | Hidden/Loading | E.V.O. analysis complete |
| **Execution Assist** | Pages 2-5 | Visible | Always (may hide if health score high) |
| **Next Step** | Pages 2-4 | Disabled | User copies prompt OR health score >= threshold |
| **Complete** | Page 5 | Disabled | User copies prompt OR health score >= threshold |

### State Machine

```
Page Load (Pages 2-5)
    ↓
[Protocol Type Check]
    ↓
┌───────────────────┴────────────────────┐
│ Schema/Link Protocol                    │ E.V.O. Analysis Protocol
│                                         │
│ 1. Hide Analysis Button                │ 1. Show Analysis Button (loading)
│ 2. Show Execution Assist                │ 2. Auto-fetch E.V.O. dimension
│ 3. Next Step: DISABLED                  │ 3. Poll progress every 2s
│                                         │    ↓
│ User clicks "Execution Assist"          │ [Analysis Complete]
│    ↓                                    │    ↓
│ Modal opens with Cursor prompt          │ Check health score
│    ↓                                    │    ↓
│ User copies prompt                      │ ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
│    ↓                                    │ │ Score < 70                  │ Score >= 70
│ Next Step: ENABLED                      │ │                             │
│    ↓                                    │ │ 1. Show Exec Assist         │ 1. Hide Exec Assist
│ User clicks "Next Step"                 │ │ 2. Next Step: DISABLED      │ 2. Next Step: ENABLED
│    ↓                                    │ │    ↓                        │    ↓
│ Navigate to next page                   │ │ User copies prompt          │ Advance automatically
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘ │    ↓                        │
                                            │ Next Step: ENABLED          │
                                            └─────────────────────────────┘
```

### Copy Detection Mechanism

**Location**: `assets/js/executionAssist.js`

**Flow**:
```javascript
// When user clicks copy button in Execution Assist modal
copyPrompt() {
    // 1. Copy to clipboard
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.currentPrompt);
    
    // 2. Find current page
    const currentPage = document.querySelector('.sprint-card-page[style*="display: flex"]');
    
    // 3. Find Next Step button for this page
    const stepNumber = parseInt(currentPage.getAttribute('data-page')) - 1;
    const nextStepBtn = currentPage.querySelector(`.btn-next-step[data-step="${stepNumber}"]`);
    const completeBtn = currentPage.querySelector('.btn-complete');
    
    // 4. Enable the button
    if (nextStepBtn) {
        nextStepBtn.disabled = false;
    } else if (completeBtn) {
        completeBtn.disabled = false;
    }
    
    // 5. Update instruction label to show completion
    const instructionLabel = currentPage.querySelector('.instruction-label');
    instructionLabel.classList.add('completed'); // Shows checkmark instead of X
    
    // 6. Close modal
    this.closeModal();
    
    // 7. Log completion
    console.log(`✓ Prompt copied for step ${stepNumber}`);
}
```

**CSS State Classes**:
```css
/* Instruction label - initial state (red X) */
.instruction-label .instruction-x-icon { display: block; }
.instruction-label .instruction-checkmark { display: none; }

/* Instruction label - completed state (green checkmark) */
.instruction-label.completed .instruction-x-icon { display: none; }
.instruction-label.completed .instruction-checkmark { display: block; }
```

