## E.V.O. Integration (Analysis Protocols)

### Auto-Fetch on Page Load

**Trigger**: When user navigates to Pages 2-5 of an E.V.O. protocol

**File**: `assets/js/sprintPlan.js`

```javascript
function showPage(pageNumber) {
    // Show the selected page
    cardPages.forEach((page) => {
        const pageNum = parseInt(page.getAttribute('data-page'));
        if (pageNum === pageNumber) {
            page.style.display = 'flex';
            
            // Auto-fetch E.V.O. data for analysis protocols
            if (pageNum >= 2 && pageNum <= 5 && 
                (currentCardType === 'gsc_indexation_protocol' || 
                 currentCardType === 'keyword_coverage_gap_protocol')) {
                fetchAndDisplayEVOData(pageNum);
            }
        } else {
            page.style.display = 'none';
        }
    });
}
```

