│    → Next Step button ENABLED            │
│    ↓                                     │
│ [If Health >= 70]                        │
│    → Hide "Execution Assist" button      │
│    → Next Step button AUTO-ENABLED       │
│    ↓                                     │
│ User clicks "Next Step"                  │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Page 3: Step 2 (repeat flow)            │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Page 4: Step 3 (repeat flow)            │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Page 5: Step 4 (repeat flow)            │
│    ↓                                     │
│ User clicks "Complete"                   │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Page 6: Animated Completion              │
│    → Status line 1 (scanning)            │
│    → Status line 2 (established)         │
│    → Status line 3 (success)             │
│    → Trigger animation complete event    │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Save Completion to Database              │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Unlock Next Sprint Circle                │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Refresh Completed Cards Archive          │
│    ↓                                     │
│ Close Card                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
