## Summary

This universal template provides:

✅ **Consistent 6-page structure** across all protocols
✅ **Linear progression flow** with disabled-until-complete buttons
✅ **Copy detection mechanism** to ensure users take action
✅ **E.V.O. integration patterns** for data-driven analysis
✅ **State management** for tracking progress
✅ **Database persistence** for completion tracking
✅ **Sprint circle unlock** progression system
✅ **Modular protocol definitions** for easy extension
✅ **Technology-agnostic prompts** that work with any stack

**Key Principle**: The template is content-agnostic. Protocol definitions provide the "what" (mission, steps, insights), while the template provides the "how" (structure, buttons, progression, state).
